    "text": "Divider + RC low-pass",
    "x": 1500,
    "y": 1400,
    "size": 90,
    "rot": 0
   },
   {
    "id": "x2",
    "text": "DIV = IN x R3 / (R1 + R3) = IN / 2   (source impedance R1 || R3 = 5 k)\nfc = 1 / (2 pi (5k + 1k) 100n) = approx. 265 Hz  (R2, C1)\nAC analysis: Bode plot of OUT.  Transient: 2 V / 1 kHz sine in, ~0.25 V out.",
    "x": 1500,
    "y": 3500,
    "size": 50,
    "rot": 0
   }
  ],
